# M-01: Problem and First Workflow Are Clear

## Outcome

The project can explain who it serves, what problem it solves, what is in scope, and what is intentionally out of scope.

## Exit Criteria

- Brief is reviewed.
- Core workflow is described.
- First requirements are verifiable.

## Gate

Soft gate. The project may run discovery experiments, but implementation of the main vertical slice waits for architecture baseline.
